[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439753533","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98551#issuecomment-2439753533","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98551","id":2439753533,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Ra689","user":{"login":"tracefree","id":155747722,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUiFig","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155747722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree","html_url":"https://github.com/tracefree","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-26T22:21:00Z","updated_at":"2024-10-26T22:21:52Z","body":"Tried digging around a bit and found that during `ResourceLoaderText::load()`, which gets called when loading `item.tres` with `preload`, the GDScript object for `Item` gets loaded and assigned, but `is_valid` returns false. When I remove the reference to `Item` in the autoload, the scripts get loaded in a different order and `is_valid` returns true right before it's assigned to the script and everything works fine.\r\n\r\nWhat can be done about this? Can a resource with an invalid script be updated later once the script becomes valid? Or must this scenario not happen in the first place i.e. measures need to be taken to prevent the script from being invalid at this stage?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439753533/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439943842","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98551#issuecomment-2439943842","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98551","id":2439943842,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Rbpai","user":{"login":"tracefree","id":155747722,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUiFig","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155747722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree","html_url":"https://github.com/tracefree","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-27T10:19:13Z","updated_at":"2024-10-28T13:21:22Z","body":"~~Found another, possibly related issue: When I remove the autoload from the MRP the problem I described goes away (item.tres loads successfully) but I then get this error:~~\r\n\r\n```\r\nE 0:00:00:0479   _printerr: res://model.tscn:6 - Parse Error: [ext_resource] referenced non-existent resource at: res://main.gd\r\n  <C++ Source>   scene/resources/resource_format_text.cpp:41 @ _printerr()\r\n```\r\n\r\n~~`model.tscn` is what I called the scene created in the third step of the reproduction steps described above. Interestingly, this error does _not_ appear when the autoload is present. If this turns out to be a separate bug I can open a new issue for this.~~\r\n\r\nEDIT: Sorry nevermind, I messed something up and attached the a wrong script to model.tscn. The original issue still stands, just ignore this comment","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2439943842/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2446519729","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98551#issuecomment-2446519729","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98551","id":2446519729,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6R0u2x","user":{"login":"donn-xx","id":392218,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MjIxOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/392218?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx","html_url":"https://github.com/donn-xx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-30T10:40:11Z","updated_at":"2024-10-30T10:40:11Z","body":"Just gave this a try. Can confirm it freezes Godot v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\r\n\r\nNoticed this, in main.gd, comments added:\r\n```\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar item: Item = preload(\"res://item.tres\")\r\n\t# 1. Disable the autoload in settings->global\r\n\t# 2. Run\r\n\t# Invalid access to property or key 'name' on a base object of type 'Resource'.\r\n\t# So, the resource is not yet instantiated.\r\n\tprint(item.name)\r\n```\r\n(BTW, with autoload.gd _enabled_ in settings, the game freezes.)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2446519729/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2446539762","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98551#issuecomment-2446539762","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98551","id":2446539762,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6R0zvy","user":{"login":"tracefree","id":155747722,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUiFig","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155747722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree","html_url":"https://github.com/tracefree","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-30T10:48:33Z","updated_at":"2024-10-30T10:48:33Z","body":"Thanks for confirming! By the way just for completeness, the resource technically _is_ (partially) instantiated, but it's an empty `Resource` object that doesn't have the custom class attached. `print(item)` and `print(item.resource_path)` should work for example.\r\n\r\nInteresting about the freeze, I hadn't noticed that. Will investigate later.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2446539762/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455391567","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98551#issuecomment-2455391567","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98551","id":2455391567,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SWk1P","user":{"login":"rawsp33d","id":669012,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2OTAxMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/669012?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawsp33d","html_url":"https://github.com/rawsp33d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawsp33d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawsp33d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawsp33d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawsp33d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawsp33d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawsp33d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawsp33d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawsp33d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawsp33d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-04T18:13:01Z","updated_at":"2024-11-04T18:17:08Z","body":"I ran into a similarly convoluted issue that took me hours to track down. In my case it's related to preloading a scene, not a custom resource (though I do make heavy use of those as well so maybe the problem is actually tied to those).\r\n\r\nIf I preload the scene, a specific one of its direct child nodes gets stripped away when the game runs. In a `@tool` script the child node is still present. I found (eventually :sweat_smile:) that if instead of `const TheScene := preload()` the scene I `var TheScene := load()` it, it worked perfectly. VERY SPOOKY STUFF.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455391567/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2459215574","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98551#issuecomment-2459215574","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98551","id":2459215574,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SlKbW","user":{"login":"donn-xx","id":392218,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MjIxOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/392218?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx","html_url":"https://github.com/donn-xx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donn-xx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T10:16:44Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T10:16:44Z","body":"Gut-instinct: Because the OP situation seems cyclic (A -> B -> C -> A), `preload` perhaps is happening *too* early; whereas `load` is happening late enough that Godot has already sorted-out the mess.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2459215574/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2459369317","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98551#issuecomment-2459369317","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98551","id":2459369317,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Slv9l","user":{"login":"tracefree","id":155747722,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUiFig","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155747722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree","html_url":"https://github.com/tracefree","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tracefree/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T10:38:24Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T10:38:24Z","body":"Yup that appears to be what is happening. Would need to find out more about how the GDScript life cycle works internally to propose a solution.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2459369317/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607463696","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98551#issuecomment-2607463696","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98551","id":2607463696,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bar0Q","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T14:54:19Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T14:57:03Z","body":"See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/71004. Currently, preloading non-GDScript resources with cyclic dependencies is not supported.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607463696/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607474259","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98551#issuecomment-2607474259","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98551","id":2607474259,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bauZT","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T14:58:17Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T14:58:17Z","body":"Closing as duplicate of #70985.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607474259/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]